      "writtenOn": "2019-03-14T05:51:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No we cannot do this.\n\nThis was changed in last January from @UnsupportedAppUsage.\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/base/+/879513/3/core/java/android/net/LinkAddress.java#121\n\nWhen adding @SystemApi, removing @UnsupportedAppUsage makes sense and that\u0027s why we did.\nBut now if we change that name we break all apps that were using that, and we know there were at least until P because this was annotated @UnsupportedAppUsage.\n\nWe might need to take another look to the diff.\n\n\nI see two solutions to this :\n- Either we push back against the API Council\u0027s feedback\n- Or we apply this change but also create a method with the old name and @UnsupportedAppUsage that calls the new one.\n\nI favor the latter solution.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 125,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 125,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "7e4394acaeabe5005300d9a3fdf39f7b35377aaf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e5aa5606_2c612a0f",
