      "writtenOn": "2019-03-14T07:47:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After we spoke offline :\nAdd back a method with the old name like this :\n\n/**\n * For backward compatibility.\n * This was annotated with @UnsupportedAppUsage in P, so we can\u0027t remove the method\n * completely just yet\n * @hide\n */\n @UnsupportedAppUsage(maxTargetSdk \u003d Build.VERSION_CODES.P)\n public boolean isIPv6() {\n     return isIpv6();\n }",
      "parentUuid": "f685b0ed_212b43b4",
