      "writtenOn": "2019-03-14T05:51:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "More obvious here but same thing : you can\u0027t change the name of something that\u0027s @UnsupportedAppUsage. In this case because we are not making it public, we must keep the old name.\n\nBecause this is not public API, the council should not really be too concerned about this (and would probably agree that we can\u0027t change its name anyway).\n\n(alternatively we could keep the old name with @deprecated @UnsupportedAppUsage and create a new one with the new name, but I would prefer not)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1019,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 1019,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "7e4394acaeabe5005300d9a3fdf39f7b35377aaf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
